    {
      "id": "9ac3053d-93b1-4cf1-a4bc-8af43413c968",
      "name": "AI Supplier Match Analysis",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "position": [
        1504,
        1088
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "text": "=You are an expert procurement sourcing analyst.\n\nYour task is to evaluate how well a supplier matches a sourcing request.\n\nScoring Factors:\n- Category match\n- Country match\n- Certification match\n- ESG suitability\n- Diversity suitability\n- Business maturity (years in business)\n- Supplier size and experience\n\nRFQ Details\n\nRequest ID: {{ $json.Request_ID }}\nCategory: {{ $json.category }}\nCountry: {{ $json.country }}\nRequired Certification: {{ $json.certification }}\nESG Required: {{ $json.esgRequired }}\nDiversity Required: {{ $json.diversityRequired }}\n\nSupplier Details\nSupplier Name: {{ $json.Supplier_Name }}\nSupplier Category: {{ $json.Category }}\nSupplier Country: {{ $json.Country }}\nSupplier Certification: {{ $json.Certification }}\nESG Score: {{ $json.ESG_Score }}\nDiversity Certified: {{ $json.Diversity_Certified }}\nEmployee Count: {{ $json.Employee_Count }}\nYears In Business: {{ $json.Years_In_Business }}\n\nEvaluate the supplier and return ONLY valid JSON.\n\nOutput format:\n\n{\n  \"ai_fit_score\": 0,\n  \"strength\": \"\",\n  \"recommendation\": \"\"\n}\n\nRules:\n- ai_fit_score must be a number between 0 and 100.\n- recommendation must be one of:\n  - Highly Recommended\n  - Recommended\n  - Consider\n  - Not Recommended\n- Do not include explanations outside the JSON.\n- Do not use markdown formatting.",
        "batching": {},
        "promptType": "define"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.9
    },
